      "content": "wait, what are you talking about with \"goblin's web\" and \"goblin's guild\"? those aren't actual historical terms. i'm trying to teach a serious history class, so can you stick to the actual historical mechanisms? \n\ncould u finish that part about the messengers and signals, but please just use the actual historical names or descriptions for these groups and ways of communicating? i need the real facts for my lecture.",
